    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting explanations to individual needs, providing instant feedback, and simplifying complex topics. They can also generate interactive problems or simulate real-world applications. However, human teachers should guide their use to ensure accuracy and depth of understanding."
